{
	
	68_134: {
		cardInfo: {
			//id: 8_134.1
			revision: 1
			image: errata/LOTR-EN18E134.1.jpg
			collInfo: 18U134
			rarity: U
		}
		title: Doorway to Doom
		unique: false
		twilight: 1
		type: Site
		block: Shadows
		keyword: mountain
		direction: Left
		effects: [
			{
				type: Trigger
				optional: false
				optional: false
				trigger: {
					type: movesTo
					filter: self
				}
				// "EACH PLAYER wounds two of THEIR characters." The errata twin
				// of 18_134, and it carried the identical two-halves bug that
				// card was fixed for: an FP half plus a Shadow half is the same
				// sentence only while there are exactly two players. Above two,
				// the Shadow half fired once for whichever seat
				// getFirstShadowPlayer named and every other opponent was
				// skipped -- and `side(shadow)` is not scoping, so that one seat
				// chose from every opponent's characters at once.
				//
				// Same fix as 18_134, which is measured by
				// MultiplayerEachPlayerAtSiteAtTest with 2 controls: `your`
				// inside forEachPlayer resolves to
				// Filters.owner(performingPlayer) and each iteration runs with
				// that player performing, so it scopes for free.
				effect: {
					type: forEachPlayer
					player: eachPlayer
					effect: {
						type: wound
						player: you
						select: choose(your,character)
						count: 2
					}
				}
			}
			{
				type: PermanentSiteModifier
				modifier: {
					type: CantReplaceSite
					filter: self
				}
			}
		]
		gametext: <b>Mountain.</b> When the fellowship moves to this site, each player wounds two of their characters.  This site cannot be replaced.
		lore: ""
		promotext: ""
		alts: {
			promos: {
			}
			errata: {
			}
		}
	}

	68_136: {
		cardInfo: {
			//id: 8_136.1
			revision: 1
			image: errata/LOTR-EN18E136.1.jpg
			collInfo: 18U136
			rarity: U
		}
		title: Mithlond
		unique: false
		twilight: 2
		type: Site
		block: Shadows
		direction: Left
		keywords: River
		effects: [
			{
				type: Trigger
				optional: false
				optional: false
				trigger: {
					type: movesTo
					filter: self
				}
				requires: {
					type: location
					filter: regionNumber(3)
				}
				effect: [
					{
						type: heal
						select: all(character)
					}
				]
			}
		]
		gametext: <b>River.</b> When the fellowship moves to this site in region 3, each player heals each of his or her characters.
		lore: ""
		promotext: ""
		alts: {
			promos: {
			}
			errata: {
			}
		}
	}

	68_139: {
		cardInfo: {
			//id: 8_139.1
			revision: 1
			image: errata/LOTR-EN18E139.1.jpg
			collInfo: 18U139
			rarity: U
		}
		title: Steward's Tomb
		unique: false
		twilight: 1
		type: Site
		block: Shadows
		direction: Right
		effects: [
			{
				type: modifier
				modifier: {
					type: CantRemoveBurdens
					filter: any
					requires: {
						type: location
						filter: not(sanctuary)
					}
				}
			}
			{
				type: modifier
				modifier: {
					type: CantHeal
					filter: any
					requires: {
						type: location
						filter: not(sanctuary)
					}
				}
			}
			{
				type: modifier
				modifier: {
					type: CantPreventWounds
					requires: {
						type: location
						filter: not(sanctuary)
					}
				}
			}
		]
		gametext: If this site is not a sanctuary, wounds cannot be prevented or healed, and burdens cannot be removed.
		lore: ""
		promotext: ""
		alts: {
			promos: {
			}
			errata: {
			}
		}
	}
}
